       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. OWNER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD F IS GLOBAL.
       01 REC.
       05 ITEM PIC X OCCURS 8 TIMES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       GOBACK.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CHILD.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TARGET-NAME PIC X(8).
       01 SRC PIC X(8).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MOVE 'KEEP0001' TO TARGET-NAME.
       MOVE 'SAFE0001' TO SRC.
       READ F.
       CALL TARGET-NAME.
       MOVE 'NEXT0001' TO TARGET-NAME.
       CALL TARGET-NAME.
       CALL SRC.
       GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM CHILD.
       END PROGRAM OWNER.
